/-!
# Structurality from `Equation3331` through the companion `x □ y = (x ◇ (x ◇ (y ◇ x)))`

Generated by `defwork/wffit.py`.  `Equation3331` is `x ◇ y = x ◇ (z ◇ (y ◇ z))`.  The source half is
`AutBox.WordRigidFull`: two finite models of `Equation3331` on one carrier with the same table of
